  "notes": "{戦|たたか}い means battle, fight, or struggle - the noun form of {戦|たたか}う (to fight).\n\nUSES:\n- Military: {戦|たたか}いに{勝|か}つ (to win a battle)\n- Sports: {優勝|ゆうしょう}をかけた{戦|たたか}い (a fight for the championship)\n- Figurative: {病気|びょうき}との{戦|たたか}い (fight against illness)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜との{戦|たたか}い: fight/battle against ~\n- {戦|たたか}いに{勝|か}つ: to win a fight\n- {戦|たたか}いに{負|ま}ける: to lose a fight\n- {戦|たたか}いが{始|はじ}まる: the battle begins\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {戦|たたか}う: to fight (verb)\n- {戦争|せんそう}: war\n- {闘|たたか}い: fight (alternative kanji, same meaning)\n- {勝負|しょうぶ}: match, contest",
